  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [style-loader](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader) from `v0.19.0` to `v0.20.3`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Release Notes</summary>\n\n### [`v0.19.1`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/releases/v0.19.1)\n\n##### `Bug Fixes`\n\n* **addStyles:** correctly check `singleton` behavior when `{Boolean}` (`options.singleton`) ([#&#8203;285](`https://github.com/webpack/style-loader/issues/285`)) ([2bfc93e](https://github.com/webpack/style-loader/commit/2bfc93e))\n\n---\n\n### [`v0.20.0`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;0200httpsgithubcomwebpack-contribstyle-loadercomparev0191v0200-2018-01-26)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n* **addStyles:** check if `HTMLIFrameElement` exist ([#&#8203;296](`https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/issues/296`)) ([9b46128](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/9b46128))\n* **index:** enable HMR in case `locals` (`css-modules`) are unchanged ([#&#8203;298](`https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/issues/298`)) ([3a4cb53](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/3a4cb53))\n* **options:** add `transform` option validation (`{String}`) ([23c3567](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/23c3567))\n* **options:** support passing a `{Function}` (`options.insertInto`) ([e0c4b19](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/e0c4b19))\n##### Features\n\n* support passing a `{Function}` (`options.insertInto`) ([#&#8203;279](`https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/issues/279`)) ([0eb8fe7](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/0eb8fe7))\n#### [0.19.1](https://github.com/webpack/style-loader/compare/v0.19.0...v0.19.1) (2017-12-14)\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n* **addStyles:** correctly check `singleton` behavior when `{Boolean}` (`options.singleton`) ([#&#8203;285](`https://github.com/webpack/style-loader/issues/285`)) ([2bfc93e](https://github.com/webpack/style-loader/commit/2bfc93e))\n\n---\n\n### [`v0.20.1`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/releases/v0.20.1)\n\n##### `Bug Fixes`\n\n* **index:** source code indentation ([#&#8203;299](`https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/issues/299`)) ([b4642e7](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/b4642e7))\n\n---\n\n### [`v0.20.2`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/releases/v0.20.2)\n\n##### `Bug Fixes`\n\n* **urls:** skip empty `url()` handling ([#&#8203;304](`https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/issues/304`)) ([64f12dc](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/64f12dc))\n\n---\n\n### [`v0.20.3`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/releases/v0.20.3)\n\n##### `Bug Fixes`\n\n* **package:** update `schema-utils` v0.4.3...0.4.5 (`dependencies`) ([#&#8203;308](`https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/issues/308`)) ([9455888](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/9455888))\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v0.19.1\n-   [`57c457d`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/57c457d043b7e8a03a06a87995d2ef2b74495893) docs: fixed missing commas in configuration examples (#&#8203;266)\n-   [`2bfc93e`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/2bfc93e3a248e89a360d797ace06e886de403100) fix(addStyles): correctly check `singleton` behavior when `{Boolean}` (`options.singleton`) (#&#8203;285)\n-   [`6ca2ecb`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/6ca2ecbff75703ccd679ef2b176eac9c5141f52a) chore(release): 0.19.1\n#### v0.20.0\n-   [`a7734e6`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/a7734e645558b0b88e7931ea56c13aaf02f2a395) chore(package): update repository url (#&#8203;290)\n-   [`9b46128`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/9b46128cc236c9e3eed28fd249d82c5fff2477f6) fix(addStyles): check if `HTMLIFrameElement` exist (#&#8203;296)\n-   [`3a4cb53`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/3a4cb53535960fde7ffcaeefc1bf9ca5dadfd5da) fix(index): enable HMR in case `locals` (`css-modules`) are unchanged (#&#8203;298)\n-   [`0eb8fe7`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/0eb8fe71b81ea554e84fca719b5661f67047b256) feat: support passing a `{Function}` (`options.insertInto`) (#&#8203;279)\n-   [`ac8430c`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/ac8430cd486dc4493103f2dc0a3498146a41057c) ci(travis): update `node` v4.3.0...4.8.0\n-   [`e0c4b19`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/e0c4b199576f70772695f82553fecb4aef1951ed) fix(options): support passing a `{Function}` (`options.insertInto`)\n-   [`23c3567`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/23c356757deb0ccaca69ba0a763cfc9d70627ce9) fix(options): add `transform` option validation (`{String}`)\n-   [`dda8b89`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/dda8b89d36264239b7b4725723349e21c425d449) test: rename &amp;&amp; update HMR tests\n-   [`28f603f`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/28f603f679d253d7a9d1ace5a88da3057cd01366) refactor: remove comments from bundle source code\n-   [`08ce425`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/08ce425e3c635bb9d774d540a6101875e87a76fc) chore(package): update dependencies\n-   [`5d73db7`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/5d73db7ae9cd8d9dee04d4273635736c347fc839) chore(release): 0.20.0\n#### v0.20.1\n-   [`b4642e7`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/b4642e7929867c5610806a37e59cce8ae5040ee2) fix(index): source code indentation (#&#8203;299)\n-   [`ff2f3dc`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/ff2f3dcb9e99c3acea98e2887bdf653b50d0f34a) chore(release): 0.20.1\n#### v0.20.2\n-   [`91e0316`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/91e03166ba64e35f8f9484f6e9325da2309fd58a) docs(README): escape `|` character in options table (#&#8203;300)\n-   [`64f12dc`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/64f12dc1ef6fb208f13f396a34558a080d28d10b) fix(urls): skip empty `url()` handling (#&#8203;304)\n-   [`0ef853b`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/0ef853b31eab3958d81a93175f081d7a0e0f2fe2) chore(release): 0.20.2\n#### v0.20.3\n-   [`9455888`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/94558886ab2d7ad1c552c67167c518d5e2f5db40) fix(package): update `schema-utils` v0.4.3...0.4.5 (`dependencies`) (#&#8203;308)\n-   [`38bda7c`](https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader/commit/38bda7ce30f89b90f694b0755a166a1d877da074) chore(release): 0.20.3\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
